@startuml
title cti-expert v2.6 — end-to-end tool & skill flow (one skill, two layers)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign direction
skinparam BoxPadding 14
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #34495E
  LifeLineBorderColor #9BB7D4
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #F4F8FD
  ParticipantBorderColor #2C6FBB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  ActorBorderColor #2C6FBB
  ActorBackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  GroupBorderColor #C8901F
  GroupBackgroundColor #FFF3D6
  GroupHeaderFontColor #7A5810
}

actor "Analyst" as A

box "entry" #FBFCFE
  participant "**/cti** router\n<size:10>SKILL.md · 8 registered commands</size>" as CTI
end box

box "LAYER 1 · broad collector" #F4F8FD
  participant "**scripts/**\n<size:10>49 techniques</size>" as L1
end box

box "typed surface" #FBFCFE
  participant "**harness/tools.py**\n<size:10>24 @tool · MCP + SDK</size>" as MCP
end box

box "LAYER 2 · intel_engine (vendored deep pipeline)" #F4F8FD
  participant "**WebPivot**" as WP
  participant "**BinaryPivot**" as BP
  database "**knowledge base**\n<size:10>kb/ · cases/</size>" as KB
  participant "**IntelAnalysis**" as IA
  participant "**IntelGraph**" as IG
  participant "**IntelReport**" as IR
end box

A -> CTI : **/cti <target>**  [~--deep | ~--quick | ~--passive]
activate CTI
CTI -> CTI : route by target type\n<size:10>domain · IP · email · username · phone · wallet · hash · APK</size>

group #FFF3D6 STEP 0 — RECALL  //"have I seen this before?"//
  CTI -> MCP : which_cases · kb_entity
  MCP -> KB : look up seed across **every prior case**
  KB --> CTI : prior attribution?  ->  //reuse, do not re-collect//
end

group #FFF3D6 ACQUIRE  //collect raw data//
  alt domain / URL / IP
    CTI -> L1 : /sweep · /query · /subdomain · /github-osint\n/threat-check · /scam-check · /dork-sweep
    CTI -> MCP : pivot_extract · fallback_probe\nimpersonation_hunt · search_pivot · censys
    MCP -> WP : collect (keyless first, premium if keyed)
    WP --> MCP : favicon mmh3 · GA/GTM/AdSense · wallets\nemails · phones · Telegram · WHOIS · TLS · JARM
    CTI -> MCP : **intelx_search**  //paste · stealer logs · darknet selectors//
    CTI -> L1 : **/icp**  ICP filing -> PRC entity + licence serial
  else file · APK · exe
    CTI -> MCP : **analyze_artifact**
    MCP -> BP : hash · APK signing-cert SHA-256 · package name\npermissions · embedded C2 · Firebase · S3 · wallets
    BP --> MCP : **WebPivot-shaped pivot JSON**  //same graph as the web infra//
    CTI -> MCP : **anyrun_lookup**  //TI Lookup — READ-ONLY, never submits//
  else username · email · phone
    CTI -> L1 : /username · /email-deep · /phone\n/breach-deep · /stealer-log · /saas-map · /msft-recon
  end
  CTI -> L1 : /cn-corp  ·  /iban  ·  /hash-id
end

group #FFF3D6 ENRICH  //expand leads — recursive spider-map//
  CTI -> L1 : **/email-permute** //name or handle x case domains//
  L1 --> CTI : candidates //HYPOTHESES — never seeds, never ingested//
  CTI -> MCP : **reference_check**  //false-positive control//
  MCP --> CTI : **BENIGN** shared noise  ·or·  **SIGNAL** operator link
  CTI -> MCP : kb_ingest
  MCP -> KB : persist indicators + relations
  loop until the frontier is exhausted   (autonomy = auto)
    CTI -> CTI : every new identifier becomes a seed\n<size:10>confidence-gated · dedup · depth-capped</size>
    CTI -> MCP : pivot_extract · reverse_whois · cert_overlap
    MCP -> KB : merge into the case graph
  end
end

group #FFF3D6 ASSESS  //correlate · attribute · calibrate//
  CTI -> MCP : kb_cluster · kb_query_shared\ndomain_verdict · risk_signals · capability_check
  MCP -> IA : weigh the evidence
  IA -> KB : hypothesize -> tier each relation\n<size:10>attribution / corroborating / noise</size>
  IA --> CTI : cluster + **ICD-203 judgment**\n<size:10>likelihood band + evidence confidence + ACH matrix</size>
end

group #FFF3D6 DELIVER  //package output//
  CTI -> MCP : **render_diagram**
  MCP -> IG : case graph  ->  PNG / SVG / Mermaid + lifecycle timeline
  CTI -> MCP : **render_report**
  MCP -> IR : pandoc  ->  polished PDF / DOCX
  CTI -> MCP : **api_usage**  //third-party credit ledger//
end

CTI --> A : **.md · .html · .json · .csv · IOC bundle (STIX 2.1)**\n+ relationship graph  +  PDF/DOCX assessment
deactivate CTI

legend right
  **The 8 registered commands** //(work from a cold prompt, any project)//
  ====
  **/cti** <target>            route by type, run the whole chain
  **/cti-recall** <seed>       have I seen this before?  — run first
  **/cti-case** <ID> <seeds>   collect -> ingest -> cluster -> assess
  **/cti-pivot** <url|ip>      artifacts from ONE target
  **/cti-cluster** <domain>    expand + correlate an existing case
  **/cti-check** <indicator>   operator link, or shared noise?
  **/cti-report** <ID>         graph + PDF/DOCX
  **/cti-status**              backend tier · MCP tools · credit balances
  ----
  Everything else is a **convention command** — available
  once the skill is loaded via /cti or /cti-expert.
  ----
  **Keyless by default.** Premium keys only upgrade a tier;
  a missing key degrades to a note, never breaks the run.
endlegend
@enduml
